    "e5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Against the knight to f6 the pawn goes to e5 and the structure becomes an Advanced-French shape — Black's f6-knight is chased back and White has the familiar space clamp.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "3...Nf6 4.e5 reaches a French Advance-type structure with a space edge.",
   "plans": "e5, cramp, develop."
